{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Character｜结构图\nHost选择Avatar并编排绑定（原生InitAbilityActorInfo）；ASC唯一管能力输入等待许可；Extension记录当前资源并广播Ready/Released。\nHealth、Hero、CMC、LocomotionFX各自订阅Extension；Health唯一持DeathState与五token；Hero管输入会话，CMC执行移动。\n[[Character/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_角色初始化.canvas|流程图]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "host",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 外部宿主：AGGYGOCombatantState\nAttachAvatar(Pawn) → 释放旧Avatar → InitAbilityActorInfo(宿主, Pawn) → Extension广播Ready。\nHost持ASC与基础属性集，选择并复制Avatar；Destroyed/EndPlay关闭生命周期。\nReleaseAvatarBinding(ExpectedAvatar)：只释放仍是当前的Avatar。\n[[Combatants/结构|宿主契约]] · [[Teams/结构]] · [[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "data",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPawnData\n`PawnClass` / `AbilitySets` / `AbilityGroupConfig` / `TagRelationshipMapping`\n`MovementSet` / `InputConfig` / `DefaultCameraMode`：分发给对应消费者。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "character",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCharacterBase / HeroCharacter\nPawn持Extension／Health／CMC；玩家另持Hero。\nPossessedBy／UnPossessed／OnRep_Controller → Extension HandleControllerChanged → RefreshAbilityActorInfo。\n不转发绑定通知：Health、Hero、CMC、LocomotionFX各自订阅Extension。\n[[Character/结构#PawnExtension 本地 ASC 订阅|本地订阅]]\nHealth.OnDeathFinished → 下一帧 K2_HandleDeathFinished：共享角色蓝图决定去留，true 表示已处理；未配置报错。\nUninitAndDestroy：各端释放自身 ASC 关联并隐藏；服务器解除控制、设置 0.1 秒 LifeSpan。\n[[Character/结构#死亡结束后的 Pawn 处理|共享模板与死亡处理]]",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "extension",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPawnExtensionComponent\nSetPawnData→配置；InitState协调。\nHandleAbilitySystemBound(ASC)→记录资源并广播Ready；HandleAbilitySystemReleased→先清资源再广播Released。\nGetCurrentLocalAbilitySystemResource／IsLocalAbilitySystemResourceReady：当前资源句柄。\n死亡销毁前经宿主接口请求释放。",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "health",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHealthComponent\n自己订阅Extension。\nReady→InitializeWithLocalAbilitySystemResource(Extension, Resource, OutError)：验本Pawn/当前Ready/HealthSet，绑定五委托、投影死亡状态并广播初值。\nReleased／资源替换→UninitializeFromLocalAbilitySystemResource(Resource, OutError)：只释放同一资源的记录。\nDeathState唯一归Health；数值归HealthSet。\nInitializeWithAbilitySystem／UninitializeFromAbilitySystem为BP入口，正常流程不需调用。",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHeroComponent（玩家）\nInitializePlayerInput→绑定/会话；Ready资源关联到会话。\nReleasePlayerInput→按来源结束本会话请求，再归还绑定/IMC。\n等待/重试归ASC；DetermineCameraMode→仲裁。\nSet/ClearAbilityCameraMode→原Spec所有权。\n[[Input/结构|Input]] · [[Movement/结构|Movement]] · [[Camera/结构|Camera]]",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "movement",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOCharacterMovementComponent\nSetMovementSet(Data,OutError)→唯一校验并接受配置；缺失/拒绝不授执行。\nGetLocomotionSteeringSnapshot() const→只读原区间/启动暂态，消费公开scope，不凭InitState标签等待。\nHasMoveInput / GetHorizontalSpeed / IsTurnBackCurveDriven→动画语义。\n[[Movement/结构]]",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pyrios-render",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOCharacterRenderComponent\n`RefreshMaterials()`：显式槽名/材质 → MID 与原覆盖记录。\n`ReleaseMaterials()`：只释放自身覆盖与描边；同 Mesh/槽恢复原 nullable override。\n`UpdateLighting()`：显式灯/弱缓存 → 受限主光；无灯直接光为零。\n`UpdateOutline()`：显式材质 → Leader Pose 壳。\n[[Character/渲染实现|契约与限制]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Pyrios渲染.canvas|流程图]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "pyrios-materials",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Pyrios 材质资产\n`M_Pyrois_Toon`（Unlit）+ Body 1 / Body 2 / Weapon 三个 MI → 角色表面。\n`M_Pyrois_Outline` → 运行时反面扩张描边；FX01 槽位绑定 `MI_Pyrois_Body_FX`（父材质 `/Game/Characters/Shared/FX/Materials/M_FX_DissolveMaskLayers`），组件不接管该槽。\n路径：`/Game/Characters/Player/Pyrios/Materials/Generated/`。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1235,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 265,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 资源所有权与跨模块合同\nHost选择Avatar并编排绑定，ActorInfo只经原生Init/ClearActorInfo；ASC不保存绑定事务。\nExtension记录当前资源并广播Ready/Released；订阅者各自消费并清自己的资源。\nHealth唯一持DeathState与五token；Hero管输入会话与镜头，会话退役时按来源结束请求；移动执行归CMC，能力授予归Host。\n跨Host须先由原宿主释放；换人不重绑。InitState不授ASC Ready。\n[[Character/结构#PawnExtension 本地 ASC 订阅|本地订阅]] · [[Combatants/结构|Host边界]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "pyrios-mesh",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Pyrois 模型 / BP_PC_Pyrios\n模型三槽已保存 Toon MI，编辑器直接预览表面。\nBP 显式 MaterialSlots / OutlineMaterial 已迁移并冷回读。\n真实 PIE 已验证 MID/描边与主光响应；静态视口仍无运行描边壳。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 1235,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 265,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "render-compatibility",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 序列化兼容与配置验收\n`UGGYGOPyriosRenderComponent` 继承通用类，保留旧身份。\nBP 显式槽位、描边与调参已保存重开核对；legacy=false。\n真实 PIE：3 表面 MID + Leader Pose 描边；主光限幅/关灯恢复通过。\n两项渲染自动化通过；视觉还原仍有缺口。\n[[Character/渲染实现|证据与边界]]",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "local-asc-resource",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOLocalASCSubscription\nSubscribe(Extension, Callback)：订阅即回放当前Ready。\n重复Ready不回调；Released只发给已消费同一资源的订阅。\n分发前复制订阅表；Ready分发中资源被替换则停止。\nGetReadyASC／GetConsumedResource：已消费且仍就绪的ASC／资源。\nUnsubscribe：退订；订阅者自己负责撤回其它资源。\n[[Character/结构#PawnExtension 本地 ASC 订阅|本地订阅]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#Avatar 绑定|ASC]]",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "host-request-port",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## IGGYGOAvatarBindingHostInterface\nReleaseAvatarBinding(ExpectedAvatar)：只在ExpectedAvatar仍是宿主当前Avatar时释放；已被替换的旧Pawn不处理。\nPawnExtension在死亡销毁前调用。取得ASC走IAbilitySystemInterface。\n[[Character/结构#宿主释放端口|接口]]",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "health-original-resource-record",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Health订阅与五委托\n自己订阅PawnExtension（游戏世界中OnRegister与BeginPlay各尝试一次）。\nReady → 绑定HealthSet五委托并保存token；Released或资源替换 → 只移除自己的token。\nOutOfHealth在服务器上要求Spec，发Event.Death；变化经Health动态委托给UI/蓝图。\nDeathState归Health，数值归HealthSet；晚绑定只投影既有DeathState的Tag，不重播死亡事件；解绑不清死亡Tag，不隐式复活。\n[[Character/结构#Health 订阅与五委托|接口]]",
      "x": 2170,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "character-pawn-data-initialization-scope",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PawnExtension｜原同步初始化 scope\nIsPawnDataInitializationInProgress() const\n输入：游戏线程、原CheckDefaultInitialization／ApplyPawnDataToConsumers同步调用。\n输出：原调用仍在栈上的bool；无scope、登记/身份/生命周期失效为false。\nFPawnDataInitializationScope只持原Extension/Pawn/World弱身份和父scope；组件借用当前栈记录。\n嵌套正常退出恢复原父scope，最外层退出关闭；OnUnregister清指针，EndPlay先关准入/清指针。旧析构不恢复失效scope或覆盖后继。\n真实后续BeginPlay仅重开准入，新调用才有scope。\nCMC只读此公开事实；accepted Set唯一归CMC，scope不代表接受/ASC Ready/长期标签等待，不建timer或执行器。\n[[Character/结构#原 PawnData 同步初始化调用|完整接口]] · [[计划_角色与组件#同步初始化 scope 与冷启动边界|机制理由]]",
      "x": 2170,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
